{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026oBygbjPo0Z1795348045.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>選委會界別分組選舉投票結束後，點票工作展開。</p><p></p><p>投票傍晚六時結束後，票箱約六時半起，陸續運抵灣仔會展的中央點票站。政制及內地事務局局長謝小華、選管會主席陸啟康等將選票倒出。</p><p></p><p>之後展開點票工作，各界別的選舉結果，稍後會在會展的中央點票站公布。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T12:24:16.393803+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T10:48:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T18:57:38.760294+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T12:17:26.427681+00:00","content_hash":"9530ce1d92dc6bc359b63b489d7b76fd2b6b8c72fc9bf7647d5e2940654c0121","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}